"1.&nbsp; μ<sub>Eds</sub> = M<sub>Eds</sub> / (b · d² · f<sub>cd</sub>)<br> 2.&nbsp; ω, ξ, ζ aus der Tabelle (μ<sub>Eds</sub> ≤ μ<sub>lim</sub> = 0,296)<br> 3.&nbsp; A<sub>s1</sub> = ω · b · d · f<sub>cd</sub> / f<sub>yd</sub>&nbsp;&nbsp;(+ N<sub>Ed</sub> / f<sub>yd</sub> bei Normalkraft)":"1.&nbsp; μ<sub>Eds</sub> = M<sub>Eds</sub> / (b · d² · f<sub>cd</sub>)<br> 2.&nbsp; ω, ξ, ζ from the table (μ<sub>Eds</sub> ≤ μ<sub>lim</sub> = 0.296)<br> 3.&nbsp; A<sub>s1</sub> = ω · b · d · f<sub>cd</sub> / f<sub>yd</sub>&nbsp;&nbsp;(+ N<sub>Ed</sub> / f<sub>yd</sub> with axial force)",
