"Δμ = μ<sub>Eds</sub> − μ<sub>lim</sub>&nbsp;&nbsp;(μ<sub>lim</sub> = 0,296, ω<sub>lim</sub> = 0,364)<br> A<sub>s1</sub> = (ω<sub>lim</sub> + Δμ / (1 − d₂/d)) · b·d·f<sub>cd</sub> / f<sub>yd</sub><br> A<sub>s2</sub> = Δμ / (1 − d₂/d) · b·d·f<sub>cd</sub> / σ<sub>s2</sub>&nbsp;&nbsp;mit&nbsp; ε<sub>s2</sub> = 3,5 ‰ · (ξ − d₂/d) / ξ":"Δμ = μ<sub>Eds</sub> − μ<sub>lim</sub>&nbsp;&nbsp;(μ<sub>lim</sub> = 0.296, ω<sub>lim</sub> = 0.364)<br> A<sub>s1</sub> = (ω<sub>lim</sub> + Δμ / (1 − d₂/d)) · b·d·f<sub>cd</sub> / f<sub>yd</sub><br> A<sub>s2</sub> = Δμ / (1 − d₂/d) · b·d·f<sub>cd</sub> / σ<sub>s2</sub>&nbsp;&nbsp;with&nbsp; ε<sub>s2</sub> = 3.5 ‰ · (ξ − d₂/d) / ξ",
