"Beispiel: Schütz 1 × 2 m (l = 2 m in Neigungsrichtung), α = 60°, Oberkante bei y = 1,0 m.<br> y<sub>s</sub> = 2,0 m, h<sub>s</sub> = 2,0 · sin 60° = 1,73 m → F = 10 · 1,73 · 2,0 = <b>34,6 kN</b> · y<sub>D</sub> = 2,0 + (1·2³/12)/(2,0·2,0) = <b>2,17 m</b>":"Example: gate 1 × 2 m (l = 2 m in the direction of inclination), α = 60°, top edge at y = 1.0 m.<br> y<sub>s</sub> = 2.0 m, h<sub>s</sub> = 2.0 · sin 60° = 1.73 m → F = 10 · 1.73 · 2.0 = <b>34.6 kN</b> · y<sub>D</sub> = 2.0 + (1·2³/12)/(2.0·2.0) = <b>2.17 m</b>",
